# Outbox

Use a transactional outbox for an event that describes a database change. In the template, `eventPublisher.PublishAsync` stages an outbox record in the same unit of work as the aggregate. The save commits both records. A relay handles delivery after commit. Verify these semantics for the publisher installed in the target project.

```csharp
await eventPublisher.PublishAsync(new FileUploadedEvent(fileId), cancellationToken);
await dbContext.SaveChangesAsync(cancellationToken);
```
